		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Celestial centaur, head sports wide antlers. Coated in golden fur, leonine face. Knights of the agathion.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 antler +6 (2d6) and 1 hooves +6 (1d8) or 2 longbow (far) +5 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Charge</strong>. In place of attacks, move up to double near in a straight line and make 1 antler attack. If hit, x3 damage and target makes CON 15+ or stunned 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Divine Aura</strong>. Immune to hostile spells of 2nd tier or lower.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
